🍕 Restaurant Ordering System
A handy Python script to manage food orders. It handles the menu, tracks what customers pick, and calculates the bill automatically.

💬 What it does
Shows the Menu: Lists all available food and drinks with their prices.
Takes Orders: Lets you pick an item and quantity, then calculates the cost.
Tracks Everything: Keeps a running list of everything ordered during the session.
Totals the Bill: Instantly sums up the entire order so you know what to charge.

🚀 How to use it
Save the code as restaurant.py.
Run it in your terminal: python restaurant.py.
Choose an option (1-5) to navigate the system.
Select "5" to finish and close the program.

🛠️ The plan
Next, I want to add a feature to remove items if someone changes their mind and save the final receipt to a text file.